That doesn't sound good! No!

510
00:25:54,280 --> 00:25:55,560
Why now of all times?

511
00:25:55,940 --> 00:25:57,877
Vander Decken must be behind this!

512
00:25:57,960 --> 00:26:00,078
He's attacking the hard shell tower!

513
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:01,797
Shura Hachi is in danger!

514
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:04,120
Tell me, how many guards are with her?

515
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:07,574
Unfortunately, all of the
guards are tied up here, sire.

516
00:26:08,180 --> 00:26:09,220
Listen, pirates.

517
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:11,697
I need you to go check on the princess.

518
00:26:11,780 --> 00:26:13,060
This is an emergency.

519
00:26:13,420 --> 00:26:15,160
Whoa, we have to do what now?

520
00:26:15,280 --> 00:26:16,360
No, King Deptune.

521
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:18,777
We can't possibly trust
them with her safety.

522
00:26:18,860 --> 00:26:21,625
I'm afraid there simply
isn't any other choice.

523
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:25,337
The hard-shell tower is on the
northeast side of the palace.

524
00:26:25,420 --> 00:26:28,120
Please, you have to
hurry there immediately.

525
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:32,137
Do you not realize that as a hostage,
you don't get to make demands?

526
00:26:32,220 --> 00:26:33,197
Be quiet, you!

527
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:35,197
Shirahoshi is the only daughter I have!

528
00:26:35,280 --> 00:26:38,577
You may not realize, but her
life is constantly under threat.

529
00:26:38,660 --> 00:26:41,697
If anything should happen to
her while you occupy our home,

530
00:26:41,780 --> 00:26:45,697
I will send you all to your graves
at the bottom of an ocean trance!

531
00:26:45,780 --> 00:26:48,537
Well, how could I possibly
refuse going to her rescue?

532
00:26:48,620 --> 00:26:52,208
I shall rush to her aid in this,
her greatest moment of need!

533
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:54,037
Completely selflessly, of course!

534
00:26:54,120 --> 00:26:55,885
No hint of an ulterior motive!

535
00:26:57,100 --> 00:27:01,041
Although, if she wanted to show me
her panties, that would be fine.

536
00:27:01,660 --> 00:27:04,640
It might be a trap! No! This is awful!

537
00:27:04,940 --> 00:27:09,177
The only one of them who's willing to
help us has the most impure of intentions.

538
00:27:09,260 --> 00:27:11,378
She's in worse danger now than ever!

539
00:27:11,500 --> 00:27:12,857
Please take me with you!

540
00:27:12,940 --> 00:27:16,897
You don't have to untie me, but I
insist that I accompany you, skeleton!

541
00:27:16,980 --> 00:27:18,686
The tower is my jurisdiction!

542
00:27:18,860 --> 00:27:23,507
If anything happens to the princess, I
will never be able to overcome my shame!

543
00:27:25,380 --> 00:27:26,340
I understand.

544
00:27:27,780 --> 00:27:28,740
You desire.

545
00:27:43,940 --> 00:27:48,293
I'm sorry to burden you, but it truly
is my dream to go to the sea forest.

546
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:51,600
And these ten years, I couldn't.

547
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:53,897
Whenever I talk about making the trip,

548
00:27:53,980 --> 00:27:57,997
everyone goes out of their way to tell me
how dangerous it would be for me to leave.

549
00:27:58,080 --> 00:28:01,256
So I've never pushed the
issue because I'm too afraid.

550
00:28:01,740 --> 00:28:02,900
Tell me the truth.

551
00:28:03,340 --> 00:28:07,537
Are you really willing to take me to the
sea forest despite the trouble you'll face?

552
00:28:07,620 --> 00:28:08,450
Yes.

553
00:28:08,560 --> 00:28:12,100
And you promise to protect me
no matter what happens, right?

554
00:28:12,500 --> 00:28:13,500
Of course I will.

555
00:28:14,040 --> 00:28:14,870
Count on me.

556
00:28:20,620 --> 00:28:21,760
Whoa, hold on.

557
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:23,717
I'm not going to do it if you keep crying.

558
00:28:23,800 --> 00:28:25,780
And if I'm being honest here,

559
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:29,460
you'll be the one taking me,
since I can't swim and all.

560
00:28:29,620 --> 00:28:33,600
Don't cry, but that'll be
hard, because I'm so happy.

561
00:28:33,840 --> 00:28:36,097
Is there anything that
doesn't make you cry?

562
00:28:36,180 --> 00:28:39,100
Well, anyway, when we
go to leave this place,

563
00:28:39,540 --> 00:28:42,157
everyone's going to
recognize you, aren't they?

564
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:43,920
Yes, that'll be a problem.

565
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:48,336
No, it won't, because I've got the
perfect idea to get you out of here.

566
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:50,437
Mermaid Princess!

567
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:51,500
Are you alright?

568
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:54,620
Look over there at the tower.

569
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:59,277
This is worse than my greatest fear!

570
00:28:59,360 --> 00:29:02,277
Those weren't the sounds of
axes or knives like usual.

571
00:29:02,360 --> 00:29:06,637
What we heard were the bodies of human
pirates slamming against the tower.

572
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:08,057
How disgusting?

573
00:29:08,140 --> 00:29:11,780
That Vanderdecken, he's
nothing short of a monster.

574
00:29:13,180 --> 00:29:15,020
I think we're in trouble.

575
00:29:16,140 --> 00:29:17,477
I think you're right.

576
00:29:17,560 --> 00:29:19,277
It appears they all survived.

577
00:29:19,360 --> 00:29:20,577
But how?

578
00:29:20,660 --> 00:29:23,840
The Ryugu Palace is
supposed to be impregnable,

579
00:29:24,020 --> 00:29:26,520
yet we've been invaded by enemy forces!

580
00:29:27,700 --> 00:29:33,960
The king, the princess, everyone
here, we're all in danger!

581
00:29:35,600 --> 00:29:38,240
Hey, it sounds like it finally stopped.

582
00:29:39,100 --> 00:29:40,453
You ready, scaredy-cat?

583
00:29:40,900 --> 00:29:41,740
Sure.

584
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:44,120
We're counting on you, Megalos.

585
00:29:58,620 --> 00:30:00,860
Let's go! Break through!

586
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:03,750
Megalo!

587
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:05,780
And Luffy is with him!

588
00:30:07,220 --> 00:30:09,360
We're off to the sea forest!
